{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 对人物行为动机的解释和段落之间的因果衔接明显不如 Y 完整，部分感受短词也有重复，容易让观众记住情绪却没完全理解心理缘由。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，X 的短句、重点放大和随音乐出现的感受词，更容易在有限时间里抓住信息，而且音乐变化对应的细微情绪和声音质感更丰富具体。Y 的优势是把人物为什么矛盾、为什么改变以及前后心理转折讲得更完整，但部分短时段需要阅读较长的叙述，容易顾不上音乐。综合实时观看体验，我选 X，不过它确实牺牲了一部分故事的因果清晰度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "72c9350f-5179-40ad-bd80-faeb856de7c3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T115428487627Z", "elapsed_seconds": 137.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T11:56:45.910279+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cd432ed8405614ea5389dfcce1323079881f66c2170970f44661f1c61b9f6ee9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt